
# <type>(<optional scope>)<optional !>: <description>
#
# [optional body: what changed and why, wrapped at 72 columns]
#
# [optional footers, e.g.]
# BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks and how to migrate>
# Refs: #123
#
# https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/
# Enable once per clone: git config commit.template .gitmessage
#
# Types (checked by `hk util check-conventional-commit`):
#   feat, fix, perf, revert, refactor, docs, style, test, build, ci, chore
# Header at most 100 characters. "!" or a BREAKING CHANGE footer marks a
# breaking change.
